### META
directory_path: testsuite/module_web
description: Web testing module for DINS HTTP endpoints per PART5
created: 2025-01-28
modified: 2025-01-28
status: active

### FILES
test_module_web.py | Main web test module with run_tests() function
README.md | Module documentation and usage instructions

### OFFLINE_TESTS
test_static_files_exist | Verifies static web assets exist
test_html_structure | Validates HTML structure
test_css_syntax | Validates CSS syntax
test_js_syntax | Validates JavaScript syntax
test_nginx_config_exists | Verifies nginx configuration
test_api_routes_defined | Checks backend API routes

### ONLINE_TESTS
test_server_reachable | Tests server connectivity
test_root_page_accessible | Tests root page returns 200
test_api_health_endpoint | Tests health check API
test_api_sections_endpoint | Tests sections API endpoint
test_404_handling | Tests error page handling

### DEPENDENCIES
testsuite.py | Main test suite framework
urllib.request | Python HTTP client
socket | Network connectivity checks

### NOTES
Offline tests always run without network.
Online tests are skipped if no server is available.
All tests are non-destructive per PART5 specification.
